  "es": "Irlanda exporta a EE. UU. el equivalente al 18,5 % de su PIB; Alemania, el 3,2 %, y España, el 1 %",
  "en": "Ireland's exports to the US equal 18.5% of its GDP; Germany's, 3.2%, and Spain's, 1%"
 },
